        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 73.2" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="591" ed="#liebermann"/>Si presbyter hominem occidat uel monachus, ordinem perdat et<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="8" target="#Hn_73-2.lnote.oe.8"/> peniteat<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="9" target="#Hn_73-2.lnote.oe.9"/> X annis, VI<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="d" target="#Hn_73-2.lnote.oe.d"/> in pane et aqua, et IIII ieiunet in ebdomada<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="10" target="#Hn_73-2.lnote.oe.10"/> III<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="11" target="#Hn_73-2.lnote.oe.11"/> dies, ceteris utatur cibo suo.</ab>
